messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/lib/cmp_mock_srv.c
Line: 261
Function: refcert_cmp
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: Potential NULL dereference by calling X509_NAME_cmp(issuer, ref_issuer) when issuer may be NULL. The function checks ref_issuer instead of issuer before calling X509_NAME_cmp. Reachable from process_cert_request (KUR) and process_rr when the request omits the issuer field.

Source context:
